OL,3,GNEWSACollege where student died sent
OL,4,Athreat - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a sixth form college where a
OL,7,Fhigh-functioning autistic student took
OL,8,Fhis own life have faced online threats,
OL,9,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,11,FSam Coutts, 18, was found dead at Queen
OL,12,FElizabeth Sixth Form College,
OL,13,FDarlington, in January, following a
OL,14,Fmeeting with the vice-principal about
OL,15,Fsocial media posts in which he
OL,16,Fexpressed he had a crush on his support
OL,17,Fworker.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
