OL,3,GNEWSACollege where student died sent
OL,4,Athreat - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Crispin Oliver told Sam's
OL,7,Fparents staff from the college would
OL,8,Fnot be at the hearing for safety
OL,9,Freasons and proposed they instead give
OL,10,Ftheir evidence remotely.
OL,12,FHe explained the college had received
OL,13,Fan email on Monday from "an unknown
OL,14,Fperson claiming to be part of some sort
OL,15,Fof group" in which a threat was made.
